			"notes": "The fuels join the shared c: fluid tags. The tag files now sit in data/c/tags/fluid, the folder 1.21 reads, so diesel, gasoline (with premium and cheap gasoline), kerosene, premium_gasoline and cheap_gasoline are in #c:diesel, #c:gasoline, #c:kerosene, #c:premium_gasoline and #c:cheap_gasoline. Mods that accept these tags take the fuels. In Create Diesel Generators engines, CDG's own diesel and gasoline fuel types now match first, so the fuels burn on CDG's numbers there. The unused forge: tags are removed."
